      "text": "Диаграмма классов UML профиля AI. AIPackage специализирует Software/Package, делает обязательными releaseTime, suppliedBy, downloadLocation, packageVersion и primaryPurpose и добавляет autonomyType, domain, energyConsumption, hyperparameter, informationAboutApplication, informationAboutTraining, limitation, metric, metricDecisionThreshold, modelDataPreprocessing, modelExplainability, safetyRiskAssessment, standardCompliance, typeOfModel и useSensitivePersonalInformation. EnergyConsumption объединяет записи EnergyConsumptionDescription (energyQuantity, energyUnit) для finetuning, inference и training. Перечисления: EnergyUnitType, SafetyRiskAssessmentType.",
